# Why this Module ships no seed/ directory.
# A marker with no justification is a silent skip in file form; lint-config
# refuses an empty one.

The collector is stateless: it owns no named volume at all. Every byte it handles
is in flight from an OTLP client to Tempo, Loki or Prometheus.
conf/otel-collector-config.yaml is configuration, bind-mounted read-only, not
seed.
